        "original_id": "ea3c414f-fd1f-5eb6-adfe-d4ee88a89477",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Infinity on High, From Under the Cork Tree\n- People: Fall Out Boy\n- Companies: Island Records\n- Topics: album leaks, release dates\n\nFacts:\n- Fall Out Boy's album \"From Under the Cork Tree\" was released in 2005 and was commercially successful.\n- Fall Out Boy's third studio album \"Infinity on High\" was leaked onto the internet on January 19, 2007.\n- \"Infinity on High\" was officially released on February 6, 2007.\n- Island Records released \"Infinity on High\" as the follow-up to Fall Out Boy's 2005 album \"From Under the Cork Tree\".\n- The leak of \"Infinity on High\" occurred three weeks before its scheduled official release.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
